


The estream_put_wsep function "estream_put_wsep.h"

            The estream_put_wsep function indirectly sends a
            word separator to the standard error stream. The
            word separator will be either a space or a line
            break, depending on the word length specified by
            #0: a space if a word of that length would fit
            on the current line; a line break otherwise.
